		(property "Note" "12V sense divider, high side. 100k/22k gives ratio 0.1803: 14.4 V -> 2.60 V, 16 V -> 2.89 V, D1's 38.9 V clamp -> 7.0 V, inside U8's +/-20 V input protection (AVDD bleed R18 keeps that row valid with +5V absent), so nothing conducts. At 100k the divider draws 118 uA, inside the sleep budget (13.3.1). Gain calibration: see R19."
