		(property "Note" "EN clamp, anode U9_EN, cathode +12V: holds EN <= IN + ~0.2 V (tens of uA) while +12V collapses faster than EN's time constant (TPS7A16 abs max EN - IN +0.3 V). Its reverse leakage (up to 20 uA at 60 C) only adds to EN while on and is shunted by Q4 while off. 100 V part: +12V can sit at D1's 38.9 V clamp."
			(at 90.17 250.19 0)
			(hide yes)
