	(text "U9 ENABLE (review M1): EN = +12V/2 (R17/R44), so EN <= IN always. Q4 holds EN low by default; GPIO19 high (SENS_PWR_EN) -> Q5 -> Q4 off -> U9 on.\nSensor supply is OFF until software enables it; the daemon can switch it off when parked. Standby from +12V ~20 uA."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 110.49 236.22 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "7653b063-a762-4798-8c84-5921648c8a60")
	)
	(embedded_fonts no)
